# Vietnamese translations of Django admin and auth strings that Django's own
# Vietnamese catalog doesn't cover yet (new or changed in Django 5.x/6.x).
#
# This directory is listed in LOCALE_PATHS after locale/, so the project's own
# catalog still wins and Django's catalog is used for everything else.
# makemessages doesn't manage it: after upgrading Django, run
# `manage.py makedjangomessages`, then translate the empty and fuzzy entries.
